  id: Q4a
  textDA: "Hvorfor bev\xE6ger pandaer sig op og ned ad bjergene i l\xF8bet af \xE5ret?"
  textEN: Why do pandas move up and down the mountains during the year?
  multiSelect: 0
  showLetters: 1
  horizontalLayout: 0
  logAsNumber: 0
  options:
  - textDA: "For at holde sig k\xF8lige om sommeren og finde mere bambus om vinteren. "
    textEN: To stay cool in summer and find more bamboo in winter.
    correct: 1
    exclusive: 0
    icon: {fileID: 0}
  - textDA: "For at holde sig v\xE6k fra andre pandaer. "
    textEN: To stay away from other pandas.
    correct: 0
    exclusive: 0
    icon: {fileID: 0}
  - textDA: For at finde nye steder at sove.
    textEN: To find new places to sleep.
    correct: 0
    exclusive: 0
    icon: {fileID: 0}
  - textDA: "For at f\xF8lge andre dyr gennem bjergene. "
    textEN: To follow other animals through the mountains.
